## Model card (retired alias)

- **Name:** DeepSeek V4 Flash Vision Exp
- **Short description:** The old experimental vision variant of DeepSeek V3/V4 Flash, merged/retired. DeepSeek says `deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp` is retired and requests are served by V4.1-Flash (also `deepseek-v4-flash`). It is therefore an alias, not a standalone model. Canonical findings are in `model/deepseek-v4.1-flash/Cat_Jam.md`.
- Specs and benchmarks: same 552B MoE / 8B-16B active, 1M context, native multimodal, $0.15/$0.60 (off-peak) post-V4.1 and DeepSWE 74.2, HLE 36.8 etc.
- Pricing: V4.1-Flash rates (routed), no separate price for this alias.

